{"_id":"Alpha2Path000001","name":"Humanity","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"humanity","description":"<p>Hold on to human values and compassion to keep the Beast under control.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier to positive interactions with mortals, including empathy and friendliness.","resistanceTeaching":false,"precepts":[{"precept":"Remain human to resist the Beast.","violation":"Act monstrously or let the Beast dictate your choices. Frenzy itself is not automatically a violation."},{"precept":"Remind other vampires of their shared humanity.","violation":"Allow companions to act monstrously when you could intervene."},{"precept":"Respect human boundaries and well-being; feeding need not be cruel.","violation":"Violate mortal boundaries or well-being for personal gain or amusement."},{"precept":"Recognize the value of every human.","violation":"Treat mortals as inferiors or mere food."},{"precept":"Distinguish yourself from the Beast through thought and compassion.","violation":"Choose cruelty or bestial behavior when you could control yourself."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"128"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-humanity"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Alpha2Path000002","name":"Path of Caine","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"caine","description":"<p>Study Caine and the Book of Nod to understand vampiric existence and master the undead form.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier when emulating Caine's resolve, studying ancient scripture, or resisting the Beast.","resistanceTeaching":true,"precepts":[{"precept":"Exercise restraint and avoid extremes.","violation":"Choose to ride the wave of a frenzy."},{"precept":"Develop willpower and predatory instinct to master the Beast.","violation":"Act weak-willed or choose not to hunt."},{"precept":"Take the Vitae of the unworthy to draw closer to Caine.","violation":"Pass up an opportunity to diablerize a humane vampire."},{"precept":"Explore your powers and the meaning of vampirism.","violation":"Neglect an opportunity to develop powers or test your cursed nature."},{"precept":"Study the history and actions of Caine.","violation":"Ignore an opportunity to pursue vampiric lore."},{"precept":"Accept that you are no longer human.","violation":"Befriend mortals or become involved in their mundane affairs."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"130"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-caine"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Alpha2Path000003","name":"Path of Honor","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"honor","description":"<p>Use a firm code of honor, duty, and personal obligation to hold the Beast at bay.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier to tests of maintaining your resolve or fulfilling your word.","resistanceTeaching":false,"precepts":[{"precept":"Keep your word and honor agreements.","violation":"Break your word or act treacherously in an agreement."},{"precept":"Overcome fear and reject cowardice.","violation":"Show cowardice, flee a challenge, or choose to ride a fear frenzy."},{"precept":"Put duty before personal concerns.","violation":"Put personal interests above your obligations."},{"precept":"Treat equals and superiors fairly; disdain those beneath you.","violation":"Disobey your leader, mistreat peers, or associate with the dishonorable."},{"precept":"Support allies unless they act treacherously.","violation":"Fail to help or protect an ally who has not acted treacherously."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"131"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-honor"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Alpha2Path000004","name":"Path of Power","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"power","description":"<p>Pursue mastery of yourself and dominion over others through influence, strategy, and power.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier when intimidating, punishing, or exercising power over others.","resistanceTeaching":false,"precepts":[{"precept":"Punish failure swiftly, including your own.","violation":"Leave failure unpunished or deny responsibility for your actions."},{"precept":"Care for followers, but reward sparingly to demand excellence.","violation":"Treat underlings poorly or reward them too frequently."},{"precept":"Bend the surrounding world to your will.","violation":"Miss an opportunity to exploit others or help without benefiting yourself."},{"precept":"Use hate, fear, and anger while appearing benevolent.","violation":"Refuse these tools when they would let you control others."},{"precept":"Act from strength and never show weakness.","violation":"Reject an opportunity for power or accept defeat."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"132"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-power"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Alpha2Path000005","name":"Path of Temptation","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"temptation","description":"<p>Embrace the role of a corruptor, spreading vice and material temptation to master your own Beast.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier when tempting others toward debasement, sin, or indulgence.","resistanceTeaching":false,"precepts":[{"precept":"Indulge in vice, wealth, sensuality, and material power.","violation":"Exercise restraint when an opportunity for vice appears."},{"precept":"Lead others into temptation.","violation":"Encourage restraint or help someone resist temptation."},{"precept":"Embrace those with great passion and little restraint.","violation":"Embrace someone unworthy of temptation or refuse someone who has proved worthy."},{"precept":"Expect corruption and betrayal from the material world.","violation":"Trust someone completely without preparing for betrayal."},{"precept":"Tempt mortals toward damnation instead of killing needlessly.","violation":"Kill a mortal needlessly without first tempting their soul."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"133"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-temptation"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Alpha2Path000006","name":"Path of the Beast","type":"path","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/actors/VampireSymbol.webp","system":{"pathType":"beast","description":"<p>Live as a deliberate predator, balancing the Beast with intelligence and cunning.</p>","teachings":"Apply your rank modifier to hunting, survival, and instinctive animal behavior.","resistanceTeaching":false,"precepts":[{"precept":"Put survival first.","violation":"Risk your life for someone else."},{"precept":"Keep politics and technology out of the hunt.","violation":"Hunt with technology or engage in politics unrelated to hunting."},{"precept":"Balance necessary bestial acts with intelligence.","violation":"Constantly deny the Beast or abandon all rationality and cunning."},{"precept":"Live according to your true vampiric form.","violation":"Ignore your monstrous nature and pretend to be mortal."},{"precept":"Master fear so enemies cannot exploit it.","violation":"Flee frightening things unless flight is necessary to survive."},{"precept":"Remain absolutely loyal to your coterie.","violation":"Betray a companion or ally you consider part of your coterie."}],"source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 2.0 Player Guide","page":"134"}},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"path-beast"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.369","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
